                            // swept: `sizeDsymbol` live at dsymbolsem.ts:1239, AUTHORISED by
                            // `uinteger_t size(Dsymbol _this, Loc loc)` (dmd/dsymbolsem.d:993).
                            // Site cite corrected from `:7820` to dmd/expressionsem.d:7832.
                            // Resolve forward references to construct object.
